  <div class="tp-answer" id="quick-answer"><p><strong>Quick answer:</strong> the golden ratio is <strong>1.618</strong>. In the classic &ldquo;golden face&rdquo;, face length is about 1.618 times face width, the mouth is about 1.618 times as wide as the nose, and the face divides into three equal thirds. Real faces rarely match exactly, and attractiveness does not depend on it.</p></div>

